11
00:00:23,166 --> 00:00:24,633
Don't just act for momentary satisfaction

12
00:00:24,866 --> 00:00:26,200
For the sake of your partnership

13
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:28,066
I should admit my mistakes

14
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,400
and apologize deeply

15
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:31,066
What should I apologize for

16
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,400
If you think I'm wrong

17
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:35,466
I can apologize

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,666
But everyone online is questioning Brother Chengze

19
00:00:37,766 --> 00:00:38,800
That was no misunderstanding

20
00:00:39,066 --> 00:00:40,700
It was the truth being exposed

21
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,466
Sister Mom and Dad

22
00:00:42,466 --> 00:00:43,766
never felt you owed anyone

23
00:00:43,766 --> 00:00:45,033
Then take off the ring

24
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:46,700
Don't drag Yurong into this

25
00:00:46,766 --> 00:00:47,833
She's not involved

26
00:00:48,366 --> 00:00:49,200
Last night she wore my

27
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,500
wedding ring on stage

28
00:00:50,633 --> 00:00:52,600
Today she sits here saying it's a misunderstanding

29
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,633
Since she's involved every time

30
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:55,900
she's no bystander

31
00:00:56,233 --> 00:00:58,766
Su Mingyao I'm asking you one last time

32
00:00:59,366 --> 00:01:00,000
Will you delete it or not
